-10-18 20:46:35.484'),(23,'铁与硫酸铜','Fe+CuSO4=FeSO4+Cu','Fe + CuSO4 = FeSO4 + Cu','Fe + Cu2+ = Fe2+ + Cu','常温，溶液中','铁表面析出红色铜；溶液由蓝变浅绿。','活动性强的铁置换出铜离子。','CuSO4','Fe','FeSO4','Cu','Fe 失 2e-；Cu2+ 得 2e-',1,5,0,'equation.write_from_text,equation.balance,redox.identify','published','[ai_trial][human_unreviewed][trial_run][source:deepseek_r1] [inv:rxn.Fe_CuSO4] canonical=Fe+CuSO4=FeSO4+Cu; batch3导入 pending_review id=23',2,2,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-18 12:58:30.760','2026-10-18 20:46:35.484'),(24,'氧化铁与一氧化碳','Fe2O3+3CO=2Fe+3CO2','Fe2O3 + 3CO =高温= 2Fe + 3CO2',NULL,'高温','红棕色固体逐渐变为黑色/灰黑铁；有CO2生成。','一氧化碳高温还原氧化铁，是炼铁的重要反应思路。','Fe2O3','CO','CO2','Fe','C(+2)失e-→C(+4)；Fe(+3)得e-→Fe(0)',2,5,0,'equation.write_from_text,equation.balance,redox.identify','published','[ai_trial][human_unreviewed][trial_run][source:deepseek_r1] [inv:rxn.Fe2O3_3CO] canonical=Fe2O3+3CO=2Fe+3CO2; batch3导入 pending_review id=24',2,2,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-18 12:58:31.023','2026-10-18 20:46:35.484'),(25,'铜加热与氧气','2Cu+O2=2CuO','2Cu + O2 =△= 2CuO',NULL,'加热','铜表面由紫红变黑。','铜被氧气氧化生成黑色氧化铜。','O2','Cu','CuO','CuO','Cu 失 2e-；O 得 2e-（按原子计）',1,4,0,'equation.write_from_text,equation.balance,redox.identify','published','[ai_trial][human_unreviewed][trial_run][source:deepseek_r1] [inv:rxn.Cu_O2_heat] canonical=2Cu+O2=2CuO; batch3导入 pending_review id=25',2,2,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-18 12:58:31.323','2026-10-18 20:46:35.485'),(26,'氧化铜与氢气','CuO+H2=Cu+H2O','CuO + H2 =△= Cu + H2O',NULL,'加热；先通H2再加热，冷却后停H2','黑色固体变为紫红色；管口有水珠。','氢气还原氧化铜得到铜。','CuO','H2','H2O','Cu','H 失 1e-；Cu(+2)得 2e-（按原子/计量守恒）',2,5,0,'equation.write_from_text,equation.balance,redox.identify','published','[ai_trial][human_unreviewed][trial_run][source:deepseek_r1] [inv:rxn.CuO_H2] canonical=CuO+H2=Cu+H2O; batch3导入 pending_review id=26',2,2,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-18 12:58:31.602','2026-10-18 20:46:35.485'),(27,'氧化铜与盐酸','CuO+2HCl=CuCl2+H2O','CuO + 2HCl = CuCl2 + H2O','CuO + 2H+ = Cu2+ + H2O','常温或微热','黑色固体溶解，溶液呈蓝绿色（Cu2+）。','碱性氧化物与酸反应生成盐和水；非氧化还原。',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,4,0,'equation.write_from